    "text": "Gereint, also called Keraint or Gereint fab Erbin, is a Welsh hero and a cousin of King Arthur. He won Enid's hand through service to her kingly father. After marriage he gave himself to leisure and neglected his kingdom. When subjects and Enid complained, he punished Enid cruelly for repeating the criticism. He set out to disprove the rumors, dragging Enid along and demanding silence. At the castle of Owein he attempted an enchanted game held amid severed heads. He fought the maiden's fierce knight protector and killed him, ending the violent games. He then reconciled with Enid.",
